{
 "_about": "Tactical reload (client patch 90; docs/notes/tactical-reload.md): a two-clip reload (state type 314) with rounds left in the magazine lasts parameters/tactical_reload_time, an empty one reload_time, as retail 0.69d0 times them. The 28 weapon configs of state 314: each one's live reload_time is how long its tactical clip lasts in 0.26g (the game plays both clips at the tactical clip's speed over reload_time), so it becomes tactical_reload_time, unchanged, and reload_time, now the empty magazine's, is it times the same gun's 0.69d0 reload_time / tactical_reload_time (rounded to 0.01 s; to a whole second where the config's reload_time is an integer, whose type a key keeps). The reload-time modifications 2040-2044 and defect 3040 also scale tactical_reload_time, as 0.69d0's do (a second modifier, the first's value). Before weapon-details-ui-1, whose card shows reload_time. Changes the simulation.",
